{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id309406010?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"Ki0301"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-14T12:49:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"14303382498"}, "title":{"label":"客服回應甚差，apps有bug不認自己有問題"}, "content":{"label":"事先聲明，我每個月至少登入2次e-banking。某一日，用同一組密碼及user name 入都話我錯。我問客服係咪你地update 左apps 要逼人reset 所有野？客服話唔會，話我係咪記錯自己印象中既paw and user name. 我再同佢重申，我係入岩。佢都話係我入錯，個apps冇問題。一直堅持冇問題，又話係我記錯。你哋已經唔係第一次逼我rest,仲講到自己冇問題，而係我問題。 其實用sms 輸入code 核對身份，我對過係一模一樣，又話我輸入過多。客服一黎就話我吾好打多餘野，根本我聆聽別人！係咪請左劣質外勞。", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id604854994?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"頂你個肺個個暱稱都已經有人使用"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-11T19:58:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"14292516650"}, "title":{"label":"Unable to set up marathon account"}, "content":{"label":"I can’t set up a new marathon account through this garbage app this month because the terms and condition page is not loading. The actual branch near my home “moved” to a far away region. Thus I rely a lot on the bank app. Very disappointed to set up a bank account of this bank with such a poor app. Never encountered this situation in other banks.\n\nUpdate: \nEven I use the website version to try to set up the marathon account, the website will redirect me to the app, which cannot load the terms and condition page. \nI don’t know the IT has tried this or not before replying me this method. \nI hope the IT tried to fix this not loading terms and condition page problem, which should be easy as the terms and condition page for the fixed saving account has no problem at all, instead of recommending me to try another route, which turns out to be not working at all, to set up the account.\nHow IGNORANT to not try to correct themselves but to suggest the customer to try another way, which doesn’t work.\nAfter going through all these, I choose to transfer my banking to other banks instead.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
